<!doctype lake><title>07-用户手册</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1>用户手册：智能办公系统 v5.0</h1>
<blockquote><strong>文档版本</strong>：v5.0.0
<strong>文档状态</strong>：正式发布
<strong>编写日期</strong>：2026-08-08</blockquote>
